# What this teaches / copy this pattern:
# Template for `.dev.vars` - the LOCAL-DEV Worker runtime secrets/vars file that
# Wrangler loads into `env` during `pnpm dev`. Copy this to `.dev.vars` and fill in
# real local values. `.dev.vars` is gitignored (never commit it); this `.example`
# is the committed, secret-free documentation of what the Worker reads.
#
# For the DEPLOYED Worker these are set differently:
#   - PUBLIC_ORIGIN / DEMO_ALLOW_DECIDE -> `env.production.vars` in wrangler.jsonc.
#     The deployed env is selected at build via CLOUDFLARE_ENV, so `--env` is not
#     used here.
#
# This demo has NO authentication, so there is no session secret to provision:
# every `/api` route answers any caller (see the "NO AUTHENTICATION" note in
# `src/worker/index.ts`). Nothing in this file is required to start the dev server.

# Authoritative `workspace_token` `origin` body field. Set this to your registered
# workspace origin (the named-tunnel hostname in local dev, e.g.
# https://your-tunnel.example.com - replace with your own public tunnel/host).
# Leave UNSET to fall back to the incoming browser `Origin` header (the
# tunnel-loaded staff page forwards the registered origin). Deployed value lives
# in `env.production.vars` (https://sdk-demo.checktiv.com).
# PUBLIC_ORIGIN=https://your-tunnel.example.com

# Set to "true" to grant the `session:decide` reviewer capability so the embedded
# reviewer can record a decision. Omit (the default) for the READ-only capability
# subset. A decision writes real audit + decision rows into the org the key belongs
# to, so enable this only against an org you own.
# DEMO_ALLOW_DECIDE=true

# DEV-TEST-ONLY cell targeting for the SERVER mint proxy, so the guest check-in
# collect step can validate the `collect_user_info` submit path against a
# non-production cell instead of the key-derived prod host.
#
# BOTH lines are required together. The flag alone THROWS (naming the missing
# variable) rather than silently relaying to production. Leave both unset for prod
# behavior, which is byte-unchanged.
#
# `CHECKTIV_DEV_CELL_API_BASE` must be a bare https origin: no userinfo, no IP
# literal, no localhost, no path or query (see `src/shared/dev-cell.ts`). This file
# is the ONLY place it belongs - `.dev.vars` is gitignored, so a real internal
# hostname written here can never be published. Never put one in `wrangler.jsonc`:
# `scripts/assert-no-dev-cell-in-deploy.mjs` fails the deploy if you do.
#
# Pairs with the CLIENT variables in the gitignored `.env.local`:
#   VITE_CHECKTIV_DEV_CELL=us
#   VITE_CHECKTIV_DEV_CELL_SDK_API_BASE=https://sdk-api.dev.example.com
#   VITE_CHECKTIV_DEV_CELL_WORKSPACE_BASE_URL=https://workspace.dev.example.com
# CHECKTIV_DEV_CELL=us
# CHECKTIV_DEV_CELL_API_BASE=https://api.dev.example.com
